  "problem": "The Taylor series for the function $f(x)$ about $x=-2$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }(-1)^{n+1}\\frac{{3}^{n}}{n}(x+2)^{n}.\n$$\n\nFind the series expansion of ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }$\n{{field-1}}$(-1)^{n+1}:(x+2)^{n-1}$",
